    <meta name='description' content='Tapestry loom (layout v2) for the Darwin–Wedgwood family: time runs up, houses west to east by longitude, latitude as depth; each life an upright warp thread, each marriage a level weft pick (doubled when close), the dye green (darwin), blue (wedgwood) the share of descent from the founders. Generated; do not edit.'/>
